Subject: [PATCH] Add groomer time off and a local staff manager

Support one-off and weekly blocks with existing-booking conflict checks. Enforce blocks in offered slots and direct bookings, serialize schedule writes, and keep staff management on a separate localhost server. Include migration, recurrence, API, and concurrent-write tests plus operator documentation.
