+## Time off and breaks
+
+Choose a groomer, date, and time range in the local staff screen to save one-off
+time off or a weekly break. Blocks remove overlapping slots and reject direct
+bookings. Existing bookings are preserved: conflicting blocks must wait until the
+appointment is moved or cancelled. Blocks never create client reminders.
+
+Use the same `--db` path for both servers. The staff screen is local-only because
+Fernhill does not yet have staff login; do not expose port 8001 publicly. Existing
+databases gain the new table automatically. Restart running booking processes
+after installing the change. See [the time-off guide](docs/time-off.md) for setup,
+recurrence rules, conflict handling, API details, and verification.
